WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.804 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:08.074
-Josh Brolin -- when he hosted,
Sarah Palin came on,

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
which was the same night
that Will Forte

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.812 line:92%
first submitted "Fart Face."

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.482
-Given name is Carl, but he
likes to be called Fart Face.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So at dress, the sketch
does terribly.

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.387 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fart Face!

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:22.188 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Fart Face! Fart Face!

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, God, no!
-Fart Face! Fart Face!

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-But it gets in.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.261
Everyone has a sense
everyone in America is watching.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.097 size:78% position:39%
And then Josh Brolin,
he's looking up here

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.333 line:92%
at the bleachers like this...

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.469 line:92%
And he's just nodding at them.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he looks at Forte and Bill
and he goes,

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:42.809 line:92%
"Let's shut these [bleep] up."

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.811 line:92%
And that was the Emmy episode.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.479 line:92%
-They're not really pranks.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.581
We did a lot of stuff waiting
for Lorne at the read-through.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause, you know,
you're always --

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.351 line:92%
you're waiting a little bit

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so we sang
"Happy Birthday" for him

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
when it was just not
his birthday.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was like, "Oh, good,
thank you." Yeah.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he kind of was smiling.
I think he -- yeah.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.062 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.363 line:92%
-There wasn't a screen test.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:06.399 line:92%
It was a series of auditions.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first time I came here,
it was just Neil Levy.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.438 line:92%
Just me and Neil in his office,

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:14.541 line:92%
and he said, "Make me laugh."

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he sat back,
and I did my shtick.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.546
And luckily, 'cause I was
doing stand-up already --

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
See, I think a lot of
actors come,

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
somebody say, "Make me laugh,"
and you don't have an act,

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.418 line:92%
it might be pretty daunting.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did Ali, Muhammad Ali
and Howard Cosell,

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Jimmy Carter --
that's how long ago it was.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.292 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Jimmy Carter impression.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.928 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And I did Bill Cosby.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.629 line:92%
And he didn't laugh at all.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.531 size:84% position:42%
He just sat and kind of
looked at me and said,

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.366 line:92%
"Thank you." And then I left.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "Oh, I guess
didn't get it."

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then a couple weeks later
they called me

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said, "Come in.
We want to see you again."

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.241
Then I went back. This time
it was two people in a room.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they said
"Make me laugh" again,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.245 line:92%
and I did the same thing again.

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:53.646 line:92%
And they said, "Thank you."

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then another week or two
went by,

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they called me back again,
and then I went --

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was Liz Welch, Neil Levy,
and Mike Zannella,

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was one of
the producers on the show.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they said,
"Make us laugh."

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:07.794 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I did all my stuff,

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Mike Zannella
was in the back

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:12.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he did like this --
[ Weak laugh ]

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:15.001 size:81% position:41%
That was my big la--
That was the big laugh

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.336 size:84% position:42% line:92%
of the three auditions.

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:18.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-We did a sketch

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.940 size:78% position:39%
called "Blockbuster"
where I played, like,

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a hobo woman.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:26.646 size:78% position:39%
And we literally shot
all day and all night

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.715 line:92%
until about 7:30 in the morning,

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:31.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then had to be back here
at noon,

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
so the turnaround
was horrible,

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I basically, like,
slept here

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.157 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
as if it was home

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:41.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then washed, like,
my hands and feet in the sink.

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:44.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I've mostly used
this space

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.733 line:92%
to, like, recoup in some way.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think when people think
of "SNL,"

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:50.270 line:92%
they think of people doing coke,

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.907
and mostly it's me sitting
right here with a blanket on.

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:57.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪

